!Name: lwssbreeder
!CThis is, to my knowledge, the first LWSS breeder created.  It is a
!Ctype MSM breeder, consisting of an orthogonal, speed c/2 head that
!Clays down Gosper guns in such a way that the glider streams collide
!Cto form LWSS streams travelling orthogonally to the direction of
!Cpropegation of the head.
!CLucas Brown, 24 Jan 2008
!Source: jslife-oversize-20100113
